"The Grand Senate is the Artonan legislature; its members are grand senators."
"It refused Moon Thegund a permanent knight, offering free relocation a few years before."
"It held an emergency session on the Thegund corruption and sent a knight to cleanse it."
"It would consider a resource world's request for an authorized takeover and restructuring."
"Even grand senators need permission to teleport into the knights' Rapports."
